            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 50-year-old man with a history of alcohol abuse had recurring severe epigastric pain. He suffered from chronic recurrent pancreatitis; the CT-scan showed a chain-of-lakes pattern of the pancreatic duct.</AbstractText>
